{
  "schema": "request-cases/1",
  "note": "Pure request-validation cases: a parsed body or a parsed query to a value or to one ApiError code. The root value is only syntactic here; #22's root rules read the filesystem and are covered by the HTTP cases and the policy tests. Every id is synthetic.",
  "cases": [
    {
